# Veranda Update's public channel (DECISIONS V130): the files a GitHub
# release may carry, one path a line, from the package's top. Only these
# go in (tools/mkrelease.py): a file of the package that is not named here
# is left out, and a release never has more. Every one is the user's own
# work under the MIT licence (Copyright (c) 2026 Marcin Spoczynski):
# Veranda's tree (this repository) and two sibling repositories whose
# LICENSE says so (commander-calc: Veranda Calc; commander-write:
# Veranda Write).
#
# NEVER here (tools/mkrelease.py refuses them even if listed; gate update's
# host test checks it): the personal-use ports geoWrite and TopDesk (by file
# name, and by a .cvt's class, parent class or author). Both are no longer
# in the package (2026-11-21).
#
# Other people's work released with credit (the user's choice, 2026-11-21):
#   geoChess by Scott Hutter (github.com/geos64128/geochess, his permission
#   to modify with credit; engine after BMCP by Maksim Korzh, WTFPL);
#   MOD Player (x16-mod, MIT; vendor/micromod-c BSD-3 is only a test
#   oracle); Solitaire and SID Player (GPL-3.0-or-later: their source is
#   published at github.com/veranda-x16).
#
# To add one: put its path here after reading its repository's LICENSE.

