# program: it must match Veranda Write.cvt). The dictionaries themselves
# (PL.DIC, EN.DIC with their licences, PL.DIC.txt and EN.DIC.txt) are not
# in Veranda's releases nor in the package (DECISIONS V198): they are the
# release dict-1 of veranda-x16/veranda-write, fetched on demand by Veranda
# Update (Write's Tools > Get dictionaries) or copied by hand from its zip
VERANDA/DICT/SPELL.OVL

